a (32/64 bit), Win XP"],["Processor","2.0+ GHZ Single Core Processor"],["Memory","1GB RAM GB RAM"],["Graphics","NVIDIA 6200+ or ATI Radeon 9600+, Shader Model 3.0 compatible"],["DirectX\u00ae","9.0c"],["Hard Drive","3 GB HD space"],["Sound","DirectX\u00ae: 9.0c compatible"]],"rec":[["OS","Win Vista (32/64 bit), Win 7 (32/64 bit), Win XP"],["Processor","3.0 GHZ Dual Core Processor"],["Memory","1GB RAM GB RAM"],["Graphics","NVIDIA 7900 GS or Equivalent"],["DirectX\u00ae","9.0c"],["Hard Drive","3 GB HD space"],["Sound","DirectX\u00ae: 9.0c compatible"]],"deck":1,"blurb":"Drawing on old Chinese revenge stories, Kung Fu Strike - The Warrior's Rise is an arcade-style beat-'em-up spread over 28 stages. The player fights through opponents with punches, kicks and timed blocks, linking moves into long combos. Items and abilities unlocked along the way change how the fighter plays, and online leaderboards compare scores with other players.\n\nA second player can join through local co-op or fight against the first. Later stages stay demanding even at the lowest difficulty, so it suits players who like old-school brawlers and score chasing and are willing to learn the combat system properly."}}